{#
  Everything the site has published, month by month: the source design's
  essays page (decision-16, TASK-85).

  `archiveMonths` is on the context only when a page's front matter says
  `archive: true`, so including this is the whole of it. Each month is a
  heading over an `ol.list-none` of links, newest month first and newest post
  first inside it; which month a post belongs to is the CMS's answer rather
  than this file's, because a date is an instant and the month it falls in
  depends on the site's timezone (decision-11).

  No dates and no excerpts: the page is a way of finding one piece of writing
  among hundreds, and a summary under each of them would make it a listing
  rather than an index.
#}
{% if archiveMonths.length %}
<section class="archive">
  {% for group in archiveMonths %}
  <h2>{{ group.month }}</h2>
  <ol class="list-none">
    {% for entry in group.posts %}
    <li><a href="{{ entry.url | url }}"><span>{{ entry.title }}</span></a></li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
{% endif %}
